<title>UK: BOE allots 1.75 bln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 1.75 bln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 1.75 billion stg of assistance.</p>
<p>It allotted 66 million stg in bills outright and 1.684 billion stg in repos to June 17 and 18.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
